    "SurveyID": "SV_builder_de83c6ee",
    "SurveyName": "Does AI Undermine Trust—or Does It Depend?",
    "SurveyDescription": "This 2 × 2 behavioral experiment tests whether the effect of AI disclosure on trust erosion depends on (1) normative framing of AI use (neutral acknowledgment vs. active encouragement) and (2) relationship type (stranger vs. thin trust). Participants act as receivers in a trust game, deciding how much to return across four sender-transfer scenarios before and after reading an AI-assisted executive summary. The primary outcome is trust_change: post-exposure total returned minus pre-exposure total returned.",
